{
  "slug": "product-tracking-skills",
  "name": "Product Tracking",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI agent skills that make SaaS products data-ready for product analytics — from codebase scan to tracking plan to working instrumentation code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `product-tracking-audit-current-tracking` (Reverse-engineer the current state of analytics tracking from a codebase), `product-tracking-business-case` (Write a business case for adding product telemetry and analytics to a product), `product-tracking-design-tracking-plan` (Design an opinionated target tracking plan and produce an explicit delta from current state to target), `product-tracking-generate-implementation-guide` (Translate a tracking plan into an SDK-specific instrumentation guide), `product-tracking-implement-tracking` (Generate real instrumentation code from the tracking plan and instrumentation guide), `product-tracking-instrument-new-feature` (Update the tracking plan when a feature ships, changes, or is removed), `product-tracking-model-product` (Build a structured product model by scanning the codebase and talking to the user)\n- **Agents** (1): `tracking-watchdog` (Proactive tracking coverage monitor)\n- **Hooks** (1): `hooks.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install product-tracking-skills@knowledge-work-plugins` from `Accoil/product-tracking-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1
  },
